{
  "name": "Update HubSpot contacts when a Rasket email bounces",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Mark bounced addresses in your CRM\n\nWhen an email bounces for good, the contact is updated in HubSpot so nobody keeps writing to a dead address.\n\n1. **Rasket Trigger**: connect Rasket with a Full access API key. Activating the workflow creates the webhook endpoint in Rasket; n8n must be reachable at a public https address.\n2. **Permanent bounces only** drops temporary bounces, which Rasket retries.\n3. **Update HubSpot contact**: connect HubSpot and pick the contact property to set.\n4. Activate the workflow.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "58f26f41-486f-5f0d-a38b-f51384788682",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": ["email.bounced"]
      },
      "id": "2360d9f6-b09c-586a-99bd-1d590aac78e6",
      "name": "Rasket Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rasket.rasketTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "ac7fbd9c-c4cc-5dcd-a92c-cdfaf8497b72"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "5aafc17e-3bbf-555c-848e-54b8a70501a8",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.bounce.type }}",
              "rightValue": "Permanent",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6fc32ece-9656-59f5-ae92-b8b3fa34c7fe",
      "name": "Permanent bounces only",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [240, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "email": "={{ $json.to[0] }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "customPropertiesUi": {
            "customPropertiesValues": [
              {
                "property": "",
                "value": "=Bounced on {{ $json.occurred_at }}: {{ $json.bounce.message }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "4522ced7-a585-5872-8521-50f8fcf031a3",
      "name": "Update HubSpot contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [480, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Rasket Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Permanent bounces only",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Permanent bounces only": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Update HubSpot contact",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
